{
	"_comment": "Character attributes. An attribute is an ordinary stat key, fed by class grants, talents, gear and /canrpgattr; 'effects' is what each point pays out. 'schools' expands one entry over a whole family (magical/physical/all, or 'fire,frost') for stat spellpower, resist or pen. 'perClass' replaces perPoint for one class, 'affinity' scales an attribute's whole payout for a class, 'cap' bounds a payout, 'softcap' halves points past it, 'perLevel' applies once per level above 1. The 'classes' block is the default for the built-in classes; a class authored in the in-game editor carries its own grants and those win. No file = no attributes.",

